  "description": "The External Contract Analyst enables users to evaluate third-party legal documents against standard contract templates. The agent identifies and reports sections that match, differ, are missing, or have been added, focusing on the actual business impact rather than surface-level differences in wording. The resulting structured compliance report highlights substantive differences and additions, supporting legal and procurement teams with rapid, transparent risk assessment and facilitating efficient, policy-aligned contract negotiations",
